   "signal": 100,
   "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td>Survey</td><td>Route of Operation FER-DE-LANCE</td></tr><tr><td>For</td><td>Pathfinder Lance</td></tr><tr><td>Method</td><td>Long-range sensor survey along the planned route</td></tr><tr><td>Prepared by</td><td>Navigation</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Contacts in route order. Press a contact's name for its sensor profile. Danger is Navigation's estimate, 5 the highest.</p>\n<h2>1. The freight line</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Contact</th><th>Est. number</th><th>Danger</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"view-link\" role=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/scan_t1_commander_veteran_spec_op_scout.png\">SCOUT</a></td><td>2</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"view-link\" role=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/scan_t1_veteran_spec_op_assassin.png\">ASSASSIN</a></td><td>3</td><td>4</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>2. The growth</h2>\n<p>The sector returns almost no sensor signal. No profiles could be taken.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Contact</th><th>Est. number</th><th>Danger</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sensory anomaly</td><td>6-10</td><td>3-4 (est.)</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>3. Core storage and management</h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Contact</th><th>Est. number</th><th>Danger</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"view-link\" role=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/scan_t1_veteran_rpv_aegis_shield_bot.png\">SHIELD BOT (Aegis)</a></td><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"view-link\" role=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/scan_t1_rpv_archer.png\">ARCHER</a></td><td>1</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"view-link\" role=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/scan_t1_veteran_cataphract.png\">CATAPHRACT</a></td><td>1</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"view-link\" role=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/scan_t1_berserker_cargo_bay_loader_bot.png\">CARGO BAY LOADER BOT (Berserker)</a></td><td>2</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"view-link\" role=\"button\" data-full=\"assets/scan_t1_rpv_assault.png\">ASSAULT</a></td><td>2</td><td>3</td></tr></tbody></table>",
   "ref": "ILR/NAV-SR-0051-03",
   "footer": "FOR THE PATHFINDER LANCE"
